&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; width: 108px; vertical-align: top; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 4px; margin-right: 4px; text-align: justify; line-height: 16px; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;３時間/月&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 4px; margin-right: 4px; text-align: justify; line-height: 16px; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;（2023年度）&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 4px; margin-right: 4px; text-align: justify; line-height: 16px; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 4px; margin-right: 4px; text-align: justify; line-height: 16px; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;83.4％&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 4px; margin-right: 4px; text-align: justify; line-height: 16px; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;（2023年度）&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 4px; margin-right: 4px; text-align: justify; line-height: 16px; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 4px; margin-right: 4px; text-align: justify; line-height: 16px; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;90.4％&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 4px; margin-right: 4px; text-align: justify; line-height: 16px; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;（2023年度）&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td style="border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; width: 130.66666666666666666666666667px; vertical-align: middle; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 4px; margin-right: 4px; text-align: left; line-height: 16px"&gt;教育制度の充実&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; width: 160px; vertical-align: top; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 4px; margin-right: 4px; text-align: justify; line-height: 16px; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;教育方針に基づき、質の高い教育制度を充実させる。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; width: 108px; vertical-align: top; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 4px; margin-right: 4px; text-align: justify; line-height: 16px; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;今後検討して参ります。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; width: 108px; vertical-align: top; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 4px; margin-right: 4px; text-align: justify; line-height: 16px; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;－&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; width: 108px; vertical-align: top; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 4px; margin-right: 4px; text-align: justify; line-height: 16px; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;全社向けの定期的な勉強会、有志による不定期の専門的な勉強会を行っています。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 4px; margin-right: 4px; text-align: justify; line-height: 16px; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;階層教育と専門教育の各プログラムを実施しています。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p style="margin-left: 36px; text-align: left"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
</jpcrp030000-asr_E05643-000:PolicyOnHumanResourceDevelopmentAndImprovementOfInternalEnvironmentStrategyTextBlock>
  <jpcrp030000-asr_E05643-000:DescriptionOfMetricsRelatedToPolicyOnHumanResourceDevelopmentAndImprovementOfInternalEnvironmentAndTargetsAndResultsUsingSuchMetricsMetricsAndTargetsTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant">
&lt;p style="margin-left: 36px; text-align: left"&gt;②人的資本に関するもの&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style="margin-left: 36px"&gt;
